<section class="app-page">

  <h1 class="flex items-center gap-4 text-3xl font-bold text-brand-text">
    {% icon "fa-solid-network-wired", "h-7 w-7 text-brand-accent" %}
    <span>How this is built</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="mt-2 max-w-prose text-brand-muted">
    Three deployables, four data stores and twenty-five upstream services. This page is the map of what runs
    where, what holds which data, and what every endpoint is for.
  </p>

  {# Only ever filled for an Admin, from the API: this page is public HTML, so nothing about how
